  "vtt": "WEBVTT\n\n1\n00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.360\nBecause you are sleeping instead of conquering,\n\n2\n00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.440\nthe lovely rose princess has become a fiddle without a bow,\n\n3\n00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.820\nwhile poor Shaggy sits there a cooing dove.\n\n4\n00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.440\nHe has gone and gone for good,\" answered Polychrome,\n\n5\n00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:19.200\nwho had managed to squeeze into the room beside the dragon,\n\n6\n00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.860\nand had witnessed the occurrences with much interest.\n\n7\n00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:27.900\n\"I have remained a prisoner only because I wished to be one.\"\n\n8\n00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:29.470\nAnd with this,\n\n9\n00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:35.390\nhe stepped forward and burst the stout chains as easily as if they had been threads.\n\n10\n00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:39.690\nThe little girl had been asleep, but she heard the raps and opened the door.\n\n11\n00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:44.330\nThe king has fled in disgrace, and your friends are asking for you.\n\n12\n00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:50.510\nI begged Ruggedo long ago to send him away, but he would not do so.\n\n13\n00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:54.570\nI also offered to help your brother to escape, but he would not go.\n\n14\n00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:59.130\nHe eats and sleeps very steadily,\" replied the new king.\n\n15\n00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.780\nI hope he doesn't work too hard,\" said Shaggy.\n\n16\n00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.740\n\"He doesn't work at all.\n\n17\n00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:11.120\nIn fact, there's nothing he can do in these dominions as well as our gnomes,\n\n18\n00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:14.780\nwhose numbers are so great that it worries us to keep them all busy.\"\n\n19\n00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:19.420\nNot exactly,\" returned Calico.\n\n20\n00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.760\n\"Where is my brother now?\"\n\n21\n00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.100\ninquired Shaggy.\n\n22\n00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.660\n\"In the metal forest.\n\n23\n00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:27.340\nWhere is that?\"\n\n24\n00:01:28.590 --> 00:01:34.030\nThe middle forest is in the great domed cavern, the largest in all our dominions,\"\n\n25\n00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.370\nreplied Calico.\n\n26\n00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:37.930\nCalico hesitated.\n\n27\n00:01:40.350 --> 00:01:45.370\nHowever, if we look sharp, we may be able to discover one of these secret ways.\n\n28\n00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:49.550\nOh no, I'm quite sure he didn't.\n\n29\n00:01:49.550 --> 00:01:52.330\nThat's funny,\" remarked Betsy thoughtfully.\n\n30\n00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.530\n\"I don't believe Anne knew any magic, or she'd have worked it before.\"\n\n31\n00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.704\nI do not know,\" confessed Shaggy.\n\n"
}
